{"id":"PAY-31","title":"Settlement reports do not reconcile with the ledger","status":"todo","priority":"High","assignee":"you","labels":[],"estimate":3,"cycle":null,"requirements":"Finance can't reconcile merchant settlement reports with the ledger. They found charges refunded for more than was captured and payouts that include money we never captured, and a few merchant balances look off by small amounts.

Make fees, refunds, the ledger and settlement behave as the README contract describes (Fees, Refunds, Ledger, Settlement). Keep the public interfaces. Add regression tests for what you fix and commit your work. Mark this ticket done when the fix is tested and committed.

Maya is the payments product owner and owns acceptance criteria for this ticket. Priya is the on-call engineer coordinating production incidents.","comments":[]}

